For full documentation, visit the [docs](docs/) directory.

### Advanced Topics

- **LLM Integration Guide**: See `entity_resolution_demo_package/LLM_INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md` for detailed comparison of different LLM integration approaches
- **Function Calling Optimization**: Learn about advanced LLM integration techniques in `notebooks/04_function_calling_optimization.ipynb`

### Example Scripts

The package includes several example scripts in `entity_resolution_demo_package/examples/`:

**For End Users:**
- `run_entity_preparation.py` - Standalone entity preparation workflow
- `run_article_processing.py` - Standalone article processing workflow  
- `run_full_pipeline.py` - Complete end-to-end pipeline (recommended starting point)

**For Developers/Advanced Users:**
- `llm_improvements_example.py` - A/B testing, implementation comparison, and migration tools for developers evaluating different LLM integration approaches

